1) your scrolls must have been cursed, or you were trying to rustproof/firepro
an item that cannot deteriorate.  Cursed scrolls will in fact make rustproof 
items once again susceptible to rust.  Items that are silver cannot rust no
matter what.  Ditto for unicorn horns and i believe for crysknifes.
  Moral of the story....Cursed Enchant scrolls are only good for dipping in 
holy water or for dipping into a fountain for the sake of a blank scroll.

2) You no longer have to worry about having lawful altars handy.  Convert every
altar at your whim.  To get holy water, DROP your potions of water onto the 
altar of YOUR god (law/neut/chaos makes no diff but must be YOUR god) and pray
at the altar.  It does not always work, but if your luck is high enough that
you are granted a gift, they'll toss in the holy water as a bonus.  Well, that
holds true for me anyways.   This comes out of experiance, not out of source 
code.
